## 4. SessionClusterManagerImpl
**Path:** `/workspace/repo/application/src/main/java/org/thingsboard/mqtt/broker/actors/client/service/session/SessionClusterManagerImpl.java`

`@Service implements SessionClusterManager`, `@RequiredArgsConstructor`. Injected deps include `ClientSessionService`, `ClientSubscriptionService`, `DisconnectClientCommandService`, `MsgPersistenceManager`, `RateLimitCacheService`, etc.

**`processClearSession(String clientId, UUID sessionId)`** (lines 198-234):
```java
@Override
public void processClearSession(String clientId, UUID sessionId) {
    if (StringUtils.isEmpty(clientId) || sessionId == null) {
        throw new RuntimeException("Trying to clear session for empty clientId or sessionId");
    }
    try {
        ClientSession clientSession = getClientSessionForClient(clientId);
        if (clientSession == null) {
            Set<TopicSubscription> clientSubscriptions = getClientSubscriptionsForClient(clientId);
            log.debug("[{}] Trying to clear non-existent session, session subscriptions - {}", clientId, clientSubscriptions);
            if (!CollectionUtils.isEmpty(clientSubscriptions)) {
                clearClientSubscriptions(clientId);
            }
        } else {
            UUID currentSessionId = getSessionIdFromClientSession(clientSession);
            if (!sessionId.equals(currentSessionId)) {
                log.info("[{}][{}] Ignoring {} for session - {}.", ...);
            } else if (clientSession.isConnected()) {
                log.info("[{}][{}] Session is connected now, ignoring {}.", ...);
            } else {
                rateLimitCacheService.decrementSessionCount();
                if (clientSession.getSessionInfo().isPersistentAppClient()) {
                    rateLimitCacheService.decrementApplicationClientsCount();
                }
                clearSessionAndSubscriptions(clientId);
                clearPersistedMessages(clientSession.getSessionInfo().getClientInfo());
            }
        }
    } catch (Exception e) {
        log.warn("[{}][{}] Failed to clear session", clientId, sessionId, e);
    }
}
```

**Clearing non-persistent sessions:** handled in `finishDisconnect` (lines 258-271) — if `sessionInfo.isPersistent()` it marks the session disconnected and saves it (returns false); otherwise (non-persistent) it calls `clearSessionAndSubscriptions(clientId)` and returns true (session removed). Related helpers: `clearSessionAndSubscriptions` → `clearClientSession` (`clientSessionService.clearClientSession`) + `clearClientSubscriptions` (`clientSubscriptionService.clearSubscriptionsAndPersist`); `clearPersistedMessages` → `msgPersistenceManager.clearPersistedMessages`. Also `updateClientSession` clears the current persisted session when `sessionPresent && sessionInfo.isCleanStart()`.

